        },
        {
          "text": "Haridwar",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 606,
          "end": 614
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.08503583818674088
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "2. Heard learned counsel for the parties and perused the record.\n3.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 617,
      "end": 684,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "According to FIR, the petitioner and the informant met on 26.08.2022.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 685,
      "end": 754,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "26.08.2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 743,
          "end": 753
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24929940700531006
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "The petitioner assured the informant of a job and demanded Rs. 35,000/-.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 755,
      "end": 827,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3732457160949707
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "The informant paid this amount.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 828,
      "end": 859,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3169252574443817
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "According to FIR,\nthe informant was not offered any job, instead the petitioner repeatedly raped the informant on multiple occasions at various places.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 860,
      "end": 1011,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.34866806864738464
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "4. Learned counsel for the petitioner would submit that the petitioner and the informant both have entered into a compromise.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1012,
      "end": 1138,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2553420066833496
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "The informant has accepted that at the behest of some villagers, she lodged the FIR.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1139,
      "end": 1223,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3640363812446594
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "She has also accepted that she received Rs.35,000/- from the petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1224,
      "end": 1296,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3843538463115692
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "5. It is a petition under Article 226 of the Constitution of India.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1297,
      "end": 1365,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Article 226",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1324,
          "end": 1335
        },
        {
          "text": "Constitution of India",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1343,
          "end": 1364
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4091936945915222
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "In case, FIR discloses commission of offences, generally no interference is warranted.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1366,
      "end": 1452,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.573086678981781
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "The FIR in the instant case, reveals serious offences of rape etc.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 1453,
      "end": 1519,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.6389259099960327
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "In such cases, compromise cannot be a ground to quash an F.I.R.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 1520,
      "end": 1583,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.6599110960960388
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "The question perhaps that would require to be answered during investigation is as to whether the petitioner tried to tamper with the evidence and have approached the informant with some motives.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ISSUE",
      "start": 1584,
      "end": 1778,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "issue",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3775631785392761
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "Unknown vs State Of Uttarakhand And Others on 20 January, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/41458817/\n1 6.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 1779,
      "end": 1901,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Unknown vs State Of Uttarakhand And Others",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 1780,
          "end": 1822
        },
        {
          "text": "20 January, 2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1826,
          "end": 1842
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4218215346336365
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "As stated, the FIR in the instant cases discloses commission of heinous offences under the false assurance of providing job to the informant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 1902,
      "end": 2043,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4495578706264496
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "Not only this, the FIR records that the petitioner had taken Rs. 35,000/- from the informant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2044,
      "end": 2137,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.39449670910835266
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "The truthfulness, credibility or reliability of the contents of the FIR will be examined during investigation.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2138,
      "end": 2248,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4907766580581665
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "Therefore, this petition deserves to be dismissed at the stage of admission itself.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 2249,
      "end": 2332,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3075583875179291
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "7. The petition is dismissed in limine.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 2334,
      "end": 2373,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23965996503829956
    },
